OL,3,CTrial date set for man accused of
OL,4,Cconfronting Andrew Mountbatten-Windsor
OL,6,FA new trial date in December has been
OL,7,Fset for the man accused of confronting
OL,8,Fthe King's brother, Andrew Mountbatten-
OL,9,FWindsor, near his new home in
OL,10,FSandringham.
OL,12,FThe trial was due to take place today
OL,13,Fbut has been delayed until December 21
OL,14,Fdue to concerns over the mental health
OL,15,Fof Alex Jenkinson, who is facing a
OL,16,Fcharge that he caused the former
OL,17,Fprince to "fear unlawful violence".
