OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1785358073
OL,3,CTrial date set for man accused of
OL,4,Cconfronting Andrew Mountbatten-Windsor
OL,6,FThe incident took place in May in the
OL,7,Fvillage of Wolverton, near the Marsh
OL,8,FFarm home where Mr Mountbatten-Windsor
OL,9,Fwas forcibly moved by King Charles.
OL,11,FAt a hearing at Westminster
OL,12,FMagistrates Court on Wednesday in
OL,13,Ffront of Chief Magistrate Paul
OL,14,FGoldspring, the court heard Jenkinson,
OL,15,Fwho is 39, underwent a psychiatric
OL,16,Fassessment the previous day and the
OL,17,Fprosecution and defence barristers are
OL,18,Fawaiting a report.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
