PN,31903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1785358073
OL,3,CTrial date set for man accused of
OL,4,Cconfronting Andrew Mountbatten-Windsor
OL,6,FAndrew Mountbatten-Windsor was named
OL,7,Fas one of the three witnesses who
OL,8,Fwould be called by the prosecution to
OL,9,Fgive evidence when the trial takes
OL,10,Fplace.
OL,12,FHe is most likely to appear by
OL,13,Fvideolink.
OL,15,FIt's understood that Mr Mountbatten-
OL,16,FWindsor was walking his dogs on the
OL,17,FSandringham estate when he was
OL,18,Fapproached.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/6
