PN,31904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1785358073
OL,3,CTrial date set for man accused of
OL,4,Cconfronting Andrew Mountbatten-Windsor
OL,6,FMr Mountbatten-Windsor was moved to
OL,7,Fthe estate earlier this year after
OL,8,Fbeing forced to surrender the rent on
OL,9,Fhis mansion, Royal Lodge in Windsor,
OL,10,Ffollowing the controversy surrounding
OL,11,Fhis friendship with the sex offender,
OL,12,FJeffrey Epstein.
OL,14,FJenkinson is currently being housed in
OL,15,Fa hotel after previously being
OL,16,Fdetained under the Mental Health Act.
OL,18,FWednesday's court hearing was told
OL,19,Fthat online searches on Jenkinson's
OL,20,Fphone are likely to form part of the
OL,21,Fevidence when the case comes to trial.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
