PN,31905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1785358073
OL,3,CTrial date set for man accused of
OL,4,Cconfronting Andrew Mountbatten-Windsor
OL,6,FThe defence barrister, Claire Howell,
OL,7,Ftold the hearing that a police officer
OL,8,Fhad prepared a 341-page document on
OL,9,Fthe search history and downloads on
OL,10,FJenkinson's phone.
OL,12,FShe did not give details of those
OL,13,Fsearches but the chief magistrate was
OL,14,Ftold that some did include the words
OL,15,F"Prince Andrew" and "birthday".
OL,17,FJenkinson denies the public order
OL,18,Foffence against Andrew Mountbatten-
OL,19,FWindsor
