OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1785358073
OL,3,CTrial date set for man accused of
OL,4,Cconfronting Andrew Mountbatten-Windsor
OL,6,FNeither man was in court for the
OL,7,Fhearing.
OL,9,FJenkinson is on bail on condition that
OL,10,Fhe does not go near a number of
OL,11,Flocations linked to the Royal Family,
OL,12,Fwhich include Sandringham, Buckingham
OL,13,FPalace, Balmoral, Windsor and
OL,14,FHighgrove.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/6
